data: {"id": "b4508fb290004110-node_complete-layer", "run_id": "b4508fb290004110", "seq": 228, "ts_ms": 1789063063370, "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "duration_seconds": 31.96, "state_snapshot": {"layer": "Layer.ABNORMAL", "layers": ["ABNORMAL"], "layer_confidence": 0.5, "layer_reasoning": "根据工具返回数据，Namespace `aiops-case-05` 中的 Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` 处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态，且处于异常状态（`abnormal=1`）。详细错误信息显示 `FailedCreatePodSandBox`，根本原因是 CNI 网络定义 `unavailable-network` 未找到（`network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io 'unavailable-network' not found`）。这属于典型的 Sandbox 创建失败，具体由 CNI 配置缺失或错误引起。因此，Pod 状态关键字为 `ContainerCreating`，异常类型为 `SandboxCreateFailed`，当前状态判定为异常。", "layer_analysis": "{\"layer\": \"DIAGNOSIS\", \"derived_layer\": \"\", \"layers\": [], \"layer_name\": \"\", \"confidence\": 0.5, \"reasoning\": \"根据工具返回数据，Namespace `aiops-case-05` 中的 Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` 处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态，且处于异常状态（`abnormal=1`）。详细错误信息显示 `FailedCreatePodSandBox`，根本原因是 CNI 网络定义 `unavailable-network` 未找到（`network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io 'unavailable-network' not found`）。这属于典型的 Sandbox 创建失败，具体由 CNI 配置缺失或错误引起。因此，Pod 状态关键字为 `ContainerCreating`，异常类型为 `SandboxCreateFailed`，当前状态判定为异常。\", \"abnormal_pods\": [{\"name\": \"workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-05\", \"status\": \"ContainerCreating\"}], \"pod_status_keyword\": \"ContainerCreating\", \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"CNI 网络定义缺失或错误\", \"status_category\": \"ABNORMAL\", \"key_entities\": [{\"type\": \"Pod\", \"name\": \"workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-05\"}], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"CNI 网络定义缺失或错误\", \"probability\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"Events 明确显示 FailedCreatePodSandBox 且根因为 network-attachment-definitions 'unavailable-network' not found\"}], \"abnormal_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"g1\", \"status_keywords\": [\"ContainerCreating\"], \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"ContainerCreating\", \"compatible_layers\": [], \"entities\": [{\"kind\": \"Pod\