data: {"id": "b4508fb290004110-final", "run_id": "b4508fb290004110", "seq": 787, "ts_ms": 1789063122699, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh (aiops-case-05) 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态，无法创建 Pod Sandbox。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | 持续 1 分钟内反复抛出 `Warning NoNetworkFound`，指出 namespace `aiops-case-05` 中 `network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 直接定位到 Pod 启动阻塞的具体原因是 CNI 插件无法找到指定的网络附件定义 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | 实体 `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` 状态为 `ContainerCreating` | 确认为启动失败故障，与日志缺失原因一致（容器未启动，仅处于初始化阶段） |\n| 3 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"}` 当前值为 1，未检测到趋势变化 | 提供客观指标印证 Pod 持续卡在等待网络分配的异常状态 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 事件与 Metrics 相互印证，表明该 Pod 处于持续的阻塞状态。根本矛盾点由 `NoNetworkFound` 事件明确指向配置引用缺失，且由于 Pod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 阶段，Pod IP 缺失导致 Tracing 与 Logging 采集不生效（预期现象），故 Kubernetes 事件是判定本次故障的唯一决定性证据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置中引用了不存在的网络附件定义 'unavailable-network' (fact-038e6f7c3231) → Multus CNI 报 NoNetworkFound 错误，无法初始化网络接口 → kubelet 持续触发 FailedCreatePodSandBox 警告 (fact-038e6f7c3231) → Pod 停留在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态，无法创建 Sandbox\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 配置中引用了名为 `unavailable-network` 的 CNI NetworkAttachmentDefinition，但该资源在 namespace `aiops-case-05` 中并不存在。\n**影响机制**：Multus CNI 在 Pod 初始化阶段因无法找到该网络附件定义而抛出 `NoNetworkFound` 错误，导致网络接口初始化失败。这触发了 kubelet 持续的 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 重试循环，最终表现为 Pod 始终处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态且无法分配 IP 或进入运行态。依据为 Kubernetes 事件维度（fact-038e6f7c3231）及状态事实（fact-038e6f7c3231）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 32.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 50.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh: 50.2s (Evidence 43.5s, RCA 6.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 91.291, "metrics": {"run_id": "b4508fb290004110", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 91.29690623283386, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 91296.90623283386, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 71720.09682655334, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 15, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 5, "tool_duration_ms": 21742.852687835693, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 1924